/** The **\`console\`** object provides access to the debugging console (e.g., the Web console in Firefox). */
/**
 * The **\`console\`** object provides access to the debugging console (e.g., the Web console in Firefox).
 *
 * [MDN Reference](https://developer.mozilla.org/docs/Web/API/console)
 */
